  "citation": "Hahn C J; Warren S G; London J; Jenne R L; Chervin R M (No Date): Climatological Data for Clouds Over the Globe from Surface Observations (1988) (NDP-026). Carbon Dioxide Information Analysis Center (CDIAC), Oak Ridge National Laboratory (ORNL), Oak Ridge, TN (United States). Dataset. doi:10.3334/CDIAC/CLI.NDP026",
  "dataset": {
    "@context": "http://schema.org/",
